        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "38 Riverside Rise, Rushbrooke Links, Cobh, Co. Cork \r\n\r\nKW Quigg are delighted to bring to the market this beautifully presented and spacious three-bedroom, three-bathroom home, ideally positioned on a quiet cul-de-sac within the highly regarded Rushbrooke Links development. \r\n\r\nArranged over three generous floors, this impressive property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation and an excellent layout for modern family living. The ground floor features a contemporary open-plan kitchen and dining area, creating a fantastic space for everyday living and entertaining, together with a convenient guest WC. \r\n\r\nThe first floor is centred around a large, light-filled living room which opens directly onto the private rear garden. The garden is a particularly attractive feature of the property, offering a peaceful and secluded outdoor space that is not overlooked. This level also includes a generous double bedroom. \r\n\r\nThe second floor provides two further large bedrooms, including a superb master bedroom with its own ensuite. A spacious main bathroom completes the accommodation and offers excellent proportions and plenty of potential. \r\n\r\nOutside, the private rear garden provides a wonderful place to relax and unwind, with a garden shed offering useful additional storage. \r\n\r\nThe location is equally impressive. Situated in a peaceful cul-de-sac, the property enjoys a tranquil setting while remaining exceptionally convenient. A bus stop is located at the entrance to the development, while a local shop and pub are just a two-minute walk away. The nearest school is also within easy walking distance, making this an ideal home for families. \r\n\r\nWith its generous accommodation, three bathrooms, private non-overlooked garden and excellent location close to everyday amenities and transport links, 38 Riverside Rise represents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a quality home in a popular residential setting. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate what this property has to offer. \r\n\r\nFeatures \r\nspacious home \r\nalarm fitted \r\nown driveway \r\nGas central heating \r\nPrivate garden \r\nexcellent location \r\nBER Pending \r\n\r\nViewing by appointment only, Call james on 083 3820623"
      },
